      "content": "it's not just a thought though. i actually feel it physically. like it's heavy. it's like i'm a ghost in a body that shouldn't be here. everything i do feels fake because the person inside is so rotten. how can you say i deserve a future when i'm just... a mistake that hasn't been corrected yet?",
